  "bodyHash": "606f0c2a298fdbea",
  "content": "\n\n<center>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p><img style=display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"375\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n\n<p><img style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: center; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\"></p>\n\n</center>\n<hr>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p>&laquo;受够了 Minecraft 基础的用户界面？厌倦了每次靠近附魔台却只看到和工作台一样的灰色菜单吗？想为你的游戏增添一些色彩吗？</p>\n<p>隆重推出 Colorful Containers！一款容器 GUI 替换模组，旨在让每个 Minecraft 多彩交互方块的菜单都与它完美匹配&raquo;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<h2 style=\"line-height: normal;\">而现在，我带来了一个完全<strong>重</strong>制、<strong>重</strong>新贴图、<strong>重</strong>新构想的版本 —— Recolourful Containers，支持新版本、全新贴图，沉浸感更上一层楼！</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\">所有 GUI 的设计灵感均来源于其关联的方块。修复了原版 Minecraft 贴图，改进了 HUD，甚至包含原版动画 GUI，以及更多更多惊喜！</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: normal;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>贴图变更示意图：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</details>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>贴图变更列表：</summary>\n<ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>铁砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>酿造台</li>\n<li>织布机</li>\n<li>制图台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石机&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂轮</li>\n<li>锻造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投掷器、发射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔炉、高炉、烟熏炉&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>箱子</li>\n<li>带箱子的船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>箱子矿车</li>\n<li>鹦鹉螺与僵尸鹦鹉螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>物品栏</li>\n<li>配方书</li>\n<li>书</li>\n<li>信标</li>\n<li>游戏界面 (HUD)</li>\n<li>经验条&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>部分小型 UI 改动与修复</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>“Vanilla+”特性 </strong>（更多信息请阅读“安装指南”）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>带有职业显示的村民 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>末影箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴、羊驼</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 特性：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>具有所有种族与职业组合的村民 GUI <em>(OptiGUI 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(Animatica 独占)</em></li>\n<li>末影箱</li>\n<li>陷阱箱</li>\n<li>圣诞箱子</li>\n<li>带有变体的铜箱子 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>彩色潜影盒</li>\n<li>马、骷髅马、僵尸马</li>\n<li>骆驼、骡子、驴（含带箱子与不带箱子两种状态 - <em>OptiGUI 独占</em>）</li>\n<li>羊驼（含地毯颜色变化）</li>\n<li>破损铁砧、受损铁砧 <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>已填写的书 <em>(OptiGUI+Animatica 独占)&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>讲台上的书 <em>(OptiGUI 3.0+ 独占)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模组兼容：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>(OptiGUI 独占)</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\"></h4>\n<center>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">如需完整体验，请安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine</h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/optigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n<a style=\"display: inline-block;\" href=\"https://optifine.net/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"303\" height=\"60\"></a></h3>\n</center>\n\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或者仅使用 OptiFine 模组，您可以在语言设置中激活内置的“Vanilla+”模式</h3>\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用方法：</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需支持其他语言，请使用主文件下方版本页面底部的独立 VANILLA+ 资源包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth_additional_files.png\" width=\"627\" height=\"267\" alt=\"\"></p>\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p>\n<details>\n<summary>常见问题解答 (Q&A)：</summary>\n<h4><strong>问：关于列表外的问题我该去哪里询问？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Recolourful Discord 服务器</a>并在那里提问！</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>已知问题列表：</summary>\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 时：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民职业显示不生效</li>\n<li>木桶显示箱子 GUI 贴图</li>\n<li>带箱子的船会显示上次访问过的箱子类容器 GUI 贴图</li>\n<li>部分马型实体不受支持</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果仅使用 OptiFine，建议使用“Vanilla+”模式</p>\n</details>\n\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>问：箱子/潜影盒/村民职业 GUI 不生效！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请检查是否已安装 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或已将语言更改为“Vanilla+”。</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：你能添加对 X 模组的兼容吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>简短回答：理论上可以。请在评论区留下建议或在 Discord 提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我可以在整合包中使用 Recolourful Containers 吗？/ 我可以修改它吗？/ 我可以对它做 X 操作吗？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>请参阅描述底部的《使用条款》。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>问：我想支持你！我该怎么做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong>关于这点&hellip;</p>\n</details>\n\n\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p>\n<h3>如果您不想购买服务器，但仍想支持我，请与您的朋友分享此资源包，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等平台展示它！只需留下本页链接即可，我将不胜感激！</h3>\n<hr>\n<center>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>别忘了点赞和关注以获取后续更新！</strong></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/modrinth.png\" width=\"215\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p>\n</center>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.planetminecraft.com/member/chris_xeno/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Chris_XENO</a></strong>：提供原版 Colourful Containers 资源包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong>：协助编写自定义着色器代码，许多功能得以实现全靠他</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Kryqu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Kryqu</a></strong>：为村民 GUI 设计提供灵感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p>\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>使用条款：</summary>\n<p><strong>如果您认为不能对该资源包进行某项操作，请先事先征求我的同意 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>将此资源包包含在免费整合包中</li>\n<li>将其用于您的私人服务器</li>\n<li>修改此资源包（仅限个人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何媒体形式中使用此资源包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未经我同意，以任何形式在任何平台分发此资源包、其资产或修改后的资产</li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<hr>",
